---
// src/pages/index.astro
const pageTitle = "Relieve Back Pain & Master Posture Correction | 5-Min Guide";
const pageDescription =
  "Evidence-based 5-minute daily movement routines, thoracic extension, core activation, and ergonomic workstation principles for back pain relief and posture correction.";
---

<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={pageDescription} />
    <!-- is:inline prevents Astro from stripping the script on Vercel build -->
    <script is:inline src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>

  <body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased selection:bg-emerald-600 selection:text-white">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-30 border-b border-slate-200/80 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 sm:px-6">
        <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-700 text-white shadow-sm">
            <!-- Spine / Posture SVG Icon -->
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2v20" />
              <path d="M8 6h8" />
              <path d="M7 10h10" />
              <path d="M8 14h8" />
              <path d="M9 18h6" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="text-lg">Health<span class="text-emerald-700">Guide</span></span>
        </a>

        <nav class="hidden items-center gap-7 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 md:flex">
          <a href="#overview" class="transition hover:text-emerald-700">Overview</a>
          <a href="#exercises" class="transition hover:text-emerald-700">Exercises</a>
          <a href="#comparison" class="transition hover:text-emerald-700">Comparison</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="transition hover:text-emerald-700">FAQ</a>
        </nav>

        <a
          href="#exercises"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-700 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-emerald-800"
        >
          <span>Start 5-Min Guide</span>
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-200 bg-white py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-12">
        <!-- Left Content -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
            Evidence-Based Health Protocol 2026
          </div>

          <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl lg:leading-[1.12]">
            Relieve Back Pain &amp; Master <span class="text-emerald-700">Posture Correction</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
            Simple, daily targeted movement routines and ergonomic principles designed to restore spinal alignment and strengthen core stability.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3.5">
            <a
              href="#exercises"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-700 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-emerald-800"
            >
              <span>Explore Daily Exercises</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a
              href="#overview"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-50"
            >
              Read Summary
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Trust Mini-Badges -->
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
              <span>5-Minute Daily Protocol</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
              <span>Zero Equipment Needed</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
              <span>Clinically Aligned</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Visual Graphic Card (Spinal Alignment Vector Illustration) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Spinal Alignment Check</span>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">Neutral Curve</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Clean Vector Diagram -->
            <div class="my-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white p-6 border border-slate-100">
              <svg class="h-48 w-full max-w-[260px]" viewBox="0 0 260 180" fill="none">
                <!-- Reference Plumb Line -->
                <line x1="70" y1="15" x2="70" y2="165" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
                <line x1="190" y1="15" x2="190" y2="165" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />

                <!-- Slouched Posture Curve (Left) -->
                <circle cx="88" cy="34" r="12" fill="#fee2e2" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2" />
                <path d="M84 48 C98 78, 52 110, 72 152" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <text x="70" y="174" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="10" font-weight="600">Forward Slouch</text>

                <!-- Arrow -->
                <path d="M115 90 L145 90 M139 84 L145 90 L139 96" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />

                <!-- Aligned Posture Curve (Right) -->
                <circle cx="190" cy="32" r="12" fill="#d1fae5" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2" />
                <path d="M190 46 C195 75, 184 110, 190 152" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <text x="190" y="174" text-anchor="middle" fill="#065f46" font-size="10" font-weight="700">Neutral Spine</text>
              </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center text-xs">
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-2.5 border border-slate-200/70">
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-900">2 Min</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500">Thoracic</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-2.5 border border-slate-200/70">
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-900">3 Min</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500">Core &amp; Glute</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-2.5 border border-slate-200/70">
                <div class="font-bold text-emerald-700">4–6 Wks</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500">Adaptation</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl space-y-20 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <!-- TL;DR Quick Summary -->
      <section id="overview" class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/70 p-6 sm:p-9">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-emerald-700 px-2.5 py-1 text-white">
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
            TL;DR Quick Summary
          </span>
          <span class="rounded-md bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-slate-700 ring-1 ring-emerald-200">
            Answer Engine Optimized
          </span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl">
          What is the most effective way to correct posture and relieve lower back pain?
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Effective posture correction combines targeted thoracic spine extension stretches, core stabilization exercises (such as dead bugs and planks), and ergonomic workstation adjustments. Performing 5-minute daily movement snacks reduces lumbar disc pressure, relieves muscular fatigue, and establishes sustainable spinal support within 4 to 6 weeks.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Core Pillar Exercises -->
      <section id="exercises">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
            Core Pillar Exercises
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">
            Daily targeted movements to relieve muscle tightness and build structural stability.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
          <!-- Card 01 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:border-emerald-300">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700">
                  <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z" />
                    <line x1="4" y1="22" x2="4" y2="15" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">01</span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Thoracic Extension</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                Reverses forward-slumping computer posture by gently opening the chest and mid-back spine.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                  <path d="M12 6v6l4 2" />
                </svg>
                2 Mins Daily
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 02 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:border-emerald-300">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700">
                  <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">02</span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Glute &amp; Core Activation</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                Strengthens deep abdominal muscles and gluteal bridges to stabilize the pelvic girdle.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                  <path d="M12 6v6l4 2" />
                </svg>
                3 Mins Daily
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 03 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:border-emerald-300">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700">
                  <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2" />
                    <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21" />
                    <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">03</span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Ergonomic Reset</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                Adjust monitor height to eye level and keep feet flat on the floor to maintain neutral alignment.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                Workstation Check
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Comparison Table -->
      <section id="comparison">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
            Comparing Posture Approaches
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">
            Active movement vs. passive posture support braces.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
          <table class="w-full border-collapse text-left text-sm">
            <thead class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600">
              <tr>
                <th class="px-6 py-4">Approach</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-4">Primary Benefit</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-4">Long-Term Impact</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-4">Recommendation</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 text-slate-700">
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-900">Active Core Exercises</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4">Strengthens stabilizing muscles naturally</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4">High (Sustainable results)</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">
                    <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                    </svg>
                    Recommended
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-900">Passive Posture Braces</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4">Temporary tactile reminder</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4">Low (May weaken muscles if overused)</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800">
                    <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                      <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12" />
                      <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16" />
                    </svg>
                    Use Short-Term Only
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <section id="faq">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
          <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-semibold text-slate-900">
              <span>How long does it take to see posture improvements?</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-slate-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
              Most individuals experience reduced muscle tension within 7 to 10 days of daily targeted stretching. Noticeable structural posture alignment typically occurs within 4 to 6 weeks of consistent core activation.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-semibold text-slate-900">
              <span>What is the best sleeping position for lower back pain?</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-slate-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
              Sleeping on your back with a small pillow under your knees maintains the natural lumbar curve. Side sleepers should place a supportive pillow between their knees to align the hips and spine.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white py-8">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 text-sm text-slate-500 sm:flex-row sm:px-6">
        <p>Health &amp; Wellness Guide &copy; 2026</p>
        <p>Engineered for Google Search &amp; AI Answer Engines (AEO/GEO).</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
